  "visual_findings": [
    "The largest conspicuous color shifts in these selected flat interiors are the brown hair and sloth fur. Hair becomes more saturated orange/brown: red increases while blue decreases.",
    "The sloth body and pale face fur become warmer/yellower. The upper body patch changes more than the nearby lower body patch despite nearly identical outgoing RGB.",
    "Skin brightens modestly in all three channels. This is a different residual from the hair and fur warming.",
    "The pale hood loses some red/blue without a comparable green change. Blue hood paint loses red while slightly gaining blue. The teal jacket darkens in red/green while gaining blue.",
    "The central windshield-blue region changes little, while the selected exterior sky region loses some red. Fine texture/grain is more apparent on the incoming image.",
    "Buildings, poles and windshield reflections also change spatially. They cannot be safely interpreted as pure color mismatch at fixed coordinates, so no fine building or reflection region was included."
