  "measurement_limits": [
    "Byte RGB statistics are empirical SDR values, not linear-light reflectance estimates.",
    "Regions were chosen visually and checked for low internal variation, not segmented by a model.",
    "These measurements use the already protected-LUT baseline, not the uncorrected source frames.",
    "Fixed output rectangles sample flat interiors but are not dense tracked correspondences.",
